<section class="pg" aria-label="MVSep API playground">
  <header class="pg-heading"><div><span>INTERACTIVE API REFERENCE</span><h2>API Playground</h2><p>Explore real MVSep responses using the TypeScript SDK and your credentials.</p></div><strong id="pg-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">● Disconnected</strong></header>
  <aside class="pg-disclosure"><strong>Credential privacy.</strong> MVSep does not allow direct cross-origin browser requests. With your permission, keys and requests pass through an <a href="https://github.com/rikhoffbauer/mvsep-client/tree/main/playground-relay" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open-source HTTPS relay hosted on Vercel</a> before reaching MVSep. Keys remain in this tab's memory and are not saved to browser storage or sent in relay URLs. The relay's operator and hosting provider can technically process them. For highly sensitive keys use the SDK locally.</aside>
  <div class="pg-layout">
    <aside class="pg-settings">
      <h3>Connection</h3>
      <label>API keys <small>One or more, max 8</small></label><div id="pg-keys"></div><button id="pg-add-key" class="pg-minor">+ Add another key</button>
      <label>Region<select id="pg-region"><option value="apex">Default · mvsep.com</option><option value="de">Germany · de.mvsep.com</option><option value="de2">Germany 2 · de2.mvsep.com</option><option value="sg">Singapore · sg.mvsep.com</option></select></label>
      <label>Key strategy<select id="pg-strategy"><option value="round_robin">Round robin</option><option value="sticky">Sticky (fail over)</option></select></label>
      <label class="pg-check"><input id="pg-consent" type="checkbox" />I consent to transmitting API keys through the HTTPS relay.</label>
      <div class="pg-actions"><button class="pg-primary" id="pg-connect">Connect</button><button id="pg-disconnect" disabled>Disconnect</button></div>
      <button id="pg-test-keys" class="pg-primary" data-action="test-keys" disabled>Verify all keys</button><div id="pg-key-state" class="pg-muted">Not connected.</div><hr />
      <h3>Safety</h3><p class="pg-muted">Read-only requests do not create jobs. Submissions may spend credits; mutations require separate confirmation. Uploaded audio is limited to 2 MiB; prefer public remote URLs.</p>
      <button id="pg-abort" disabled>Stop local request</button><small class="pg-muted">No storage · No cookies · No automatic paid calls</small>
    </aside>
    <div class="pg-main">
      <nav class="pg-tabs" aria-label="API actions"><button data-tab="models" aria-selected="true">Algorithms</button><button data-tab="account">Account</button><button data-tab="job">Job</button><button data-tab="create">Submit</button><button data-tab="raw">Raw GET</button></nav>
      <section data-pane="models" class="pg-pane"><h3>Discover algorithms</h3><p>Fetch available model IDs. Click a result to fill in the submission form.</p><div class="pg-row"><label>Scope<select id="pg-scope"><option value="single_upload">Single upload</option><option value="matchering_upload">Matchering</option><option value="no_upload">No upload</option></select></label><button data-action="models" class="pg-primary">Fetch models</button></div><div id="pg-model-list"></div><h4>More read-only endpoints</h4><div class="pg-actions"><button data-action="news">News</button><button data-action="demos">Demo separations</button><button data-action="leaderboard">Quality leaderboard</button><button data-action="quality-queue">Quality queue</button></div></section>
      <section data-pane="account" class="pg-pane" hidden><h3>Account reads</h3><p>Unbound reads rotate keys. For reliable billing information, use one client per account.</p><div class="pg-actions"><button data-action="user">Profile / credits</button><button data-action="queue">Queue summary</button><button data-action="history">Job history</button><button data-action="purchases">Purchases</button><button data-action="alert">Credit alert</button></div></section>
      <section data-pane="job" class="pg-pane" hidden><h3>Job management</h3><p>Look up status or manage an existing job; cancellation and deletion affect MVSep.</p><label>Hash<input id="pg-hash" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Job hash" /></label><div class="pg-row"><label>Originating key<select id="pg-affinity"><option value="">Automatic rotation</option></select></label><button data-action="bind">Bind key</button></div><div class="pg-actions"><button class="pg-primary" data-action="status">Status</button><button data-action="wait">Wait for result</button><button data-action="remote">Remote status</button><button class="pg-danger" data-action="cancel">Cancel job</button><button class="pg-danger" data-action="delete">Delete job</button></div></section>
      <section data-pane="create" class="pg-pane" hidden><h3>Create a separation</h3><p>Submitting can consume paid credits. We ask for explicit confirmation.</p><div class="pg-row"><label>Algorithm ID<input id="pg-algorithm" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Choose a model" /></label><label>Output format<select id="pg-format"><option value="">Default</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option></select></label></div><div class="pg-radio"><label><input type="radio" name="pg-input" value="url" checked /> Remote URL</label><label><input type="radio" name="pg-input" value="file" /> Small file</label><label><input type="radio" name="pg-input" value="no_upload" /> No upload</label></div><label id="pg-url-field">HTTPS audio URL<input id="pg-url" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com/music.wav" /></label><label id="pg-file-field" hidden>Audio file (max 2 MiB)<input id="pg-file" type="file" accept="audio/*,.wav,.mp3,.flac,.ogg,.m4a" /></label><div class="pg-row"><label>add_opt1 (optional)<input id="pg-opt1" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Model option value" /></label><label>add_opt2 (optional)<input id="pg-opt2" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Model option value" /></label><label>add_opt3 (optional)<input id="pg-opt3" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Model option value" /></label></div><p class="pg-muted">Discover permitted option values in the algorithm response. Presets and two-file matchering workflows are supported by the SDK but not this small-file playground.</p><button data-action="create" class="pg-primary">Confirm & submit</button></section>
      <section data-pane="raw" class="pg-pane" hidden><h3>Low-level GET</h3><p>Invoke <code>request&lt;T&gt;()</code> using a fixed allowlist of safe endpoints.</p><div class="pg-row"><label>Path<select id="pg-endpoint"><option value="/app/algorithms">/app/algorithms</option><option value="/app/user">/app/user</option><option value="/app/queue">/app/queue</option><option value="/app/queue/summary">/app/queue/summary</option><option value="/app/news">/app/news</option><option value="/quality_checker/leaderboard">/quality_checker/leaderboard</option></select></label><button data-action="raw" class="pg-primary">Send GET</button></div></section>
      <div class="pg-result"><header><strong>Response <small id="pg-operation">NONE</small></strong><div><button id="pg-copy" disabled>Copy</button><button id="pg-clear">Clear</button></div></header><pre id="pg-response" tabindex="0">// Connect, then choose an operation.
// No API keys will appear in these results.</pre><footer><span id="pg-response-status" aria-live="polite">Ready</span><span id="pg-duration">—</span></footer></div>
      <details class="pg-events"><summary>Request activity <span id="pg-events-count">0</span></summary><ol id="pg-events"></ol></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/playground.ts';</script>
<style>
.pg{--border:var(--sl-color-gray-5);--muted:var(--sl-color-gray-3);--soft:var(--sl-color-bg-nav);margin:1.5rem 0 3rem;font-size:.85rem}.pg *{box-sizing:border-box}.pg-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}.pg-heading h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:.2rem 0}.pg-heading span{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:800;color:var(--sl-color-text-accent)}.pg-heading p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}#pg-status{font-size:.77rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:2rem;padding:.55rem .8rem;white-space:nowrap}#pg-status.connected{color:var(--sl-color-text-accent)}.pg-disclosure{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--sl-color-accent);padding:1rem 1.15rem;border-radius:.55rem;margin-bottom:1.3rem;line-height:1.6}.pg-disclosure a{text-decoration:underline}.pg-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(240px,290px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.25rem;align-items:start}.pg-settings{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.1rem;border-radius:.7rem;display:grid;gap:.7rem}.pg-settings h3,.pg-pane h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0}.pg-settings label,.pg-pane label{display:grid;gap:.4rem;font-weight:650;font-size:.8rem}.pg-settings small,.pg-muted,.pg-pane>p{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;line-height:1.55}.pg-settings label small{font-size:.7rem}.pg select,.pg input:not([type=radio]):not([type=checkbox]),.pg-pane select,.pg-pane input:not([type=radio]){width:100%;background:var(--sl-color-bg);color:var(--sl-color-text);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.66rem;border-radius:.45rem;font:inherit}.pg .pg-check{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:.55rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5}.pg-check input{margin-top:.18rem;accent-color:var(--sl-color-accent)}.pg-actions,.pg-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;gap:.5rem;margin:.85rem 0}.pg-row label{flex:1;min-width:145px}.pg button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;font-size:.8rem;padding:.64rem .8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--sl-color-text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.45rem;background:var(--sl-color-bg)}.pg button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.pg button.pg-primary{background:var(--sl-color-accent);color:var(--sl-color-bg);border-color:var(--sl-color-accent)}.pg button.pg-danger{color:#dc7565;border-color:#bd6359}.pg button.pg-minor{background:none;border:0;text-align:left;color:var(--sl-color-text-accent);padding:.15rem}.pg .pg-key-row{display:flex;gap:.35rem;margin:.35rem 0}.pg-key-row input{flex:1}.pg-key-row button{width:2.2rem}.pg-tabs{display:flex;gap:.2rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);overflow:auto;margin-bottom:1.1rem}.pg-tabs button{border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}.pg-tabs button[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--sl-color-text-accent);border-color:var(--sl-color-accent)}.pg-pane{padding:.3rem 0 1rem}.pg-pane>p{margin:.4rem 0 1.1rem}.pg-pane[hidden],#pg-url-field[hidden],#pg-file-field[hidden]{display:none}.pg-pane>label{margin:.85rem 0}.pg-radio{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin:.9rem 0}.pg-radio label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;font-weight:400}#pg-model-list{max-height:240px;overflow:auto}#pg-model-list button{display:flex;text-align:left;width:100%;gap:.7rem;border-radius:0;border-width:0 0 1px}#pg-model-list b{min-width:2rem;color:var(--sl-color-text-accent)}.pg-result{margin-top:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--soft);overflow:hidden}.pg-result header,.pg-result footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.7rem .9rem}.pg-result header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.pg-result header button{background:none;border:0;padding:.2rem;color:var(--sl-color-text-accent)}.pg-result small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;margin-left:.4rem}.pg-result pre{margin:0;max-height:430px;min-height:240px;padding:1.2rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:transparent;color:var(--sl-color-text);font-size:.77rem}.pg-result footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}.pg-events{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.5rem;margin-top:.8rem;padding:.7rem .9rem;font-size:.77rem}.pg-events summary{cursor:pointer}.pg-events ol{max-height:160px;overflow:auto}@media(max-width:870px){.pg-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:490px){.pg-heading{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
